    <heading>Experiment Example 13</heading>
    <div class="description-paragraph">A precursor film sample of polyethylene was prepared according to the method described in Experiment Example 9. Intrinsic viscosity, film-forming conditions and characteristic properties of the precursor film are shown in Table 37.</div>
